@node Top
@top raspdash

raspdash shows, on a terminal filling the Pi's screen, the state of the
machines on the local network, their uptime and the power cuts they
went through, Google Tasks lists, the week's university timetable,
weather forecasts, market charts and a Monero dashboard.

